### 1. Inventory report - default filters and pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/reports/inventory/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2. Filter by date range and chart year
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/reports/inventory/?start_date=2026-01-01&end_date=2026-10-23&chart_year=2026
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. Filter by warehouse
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/reports/inventory/?warehouse=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Filter by category
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/reports/inventory/?category=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Filter by product
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/reports/inventory/?product=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Filter by product type
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/reports/inventory/?product_type=product
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Search by code, SKU, or product name
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/reports/inventory/?search=PROD
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. Pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/reports/inventory/?page=2&page_size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. Combine filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/reports/inventory/?warehouse=1&category=1&product_type=product&chart_year=2026&page=1&page_size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 10. Invalid date test
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/reports/inventory/?start_date=invalid-date
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
